 0 8px 0;\"><strong>Status:</strong> Cleared by Firm Administration</p><p style=\"color: #166534; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\"><strong>Resolution Notes:</strong> {{ $('Conflict Review Form').first().json['Resolution Comments / Justification'] }}</p></div><div style=\"background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 22px;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\"><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;\"><td style=\"width: 38%; color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;\">Case Reference ID:</td><td><code style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #065f46; background: #e6f4ea; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px;\">#{{ $('Lookup Case in Directory').first().json.case_id }}</code></td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;\"><td style=\"color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;\">Client Name:</td><td><strong style=\"color: #0f172a;\">{{ $('Lookup Case in Directory').first().json.client_name }}</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;\"><td style=\"color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;\">Case Status:</td><td><span style=\"background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;\">ACTIVE</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;\">Proceeding Stage:</td><td><span style=\"color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600;\">Paper Filed / Counsel Assignment</span></td></tr></table></div><div style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 22px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\"><strong>Next Steps:</strong> A lead litigation advocate will be formally assigned to your case docket. You will receive hearing listings, litigation checklists, and engagement paperwork directly in your portal.</p></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 26px 0 18px 0;\"><a href=\"{{ $vars.CLIENT_PORTAL_URL }}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #047857; color: #ffffff; padding: 13px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(4,120,87,0.3);\">📱 Open Case in Client Portal ➔</a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 24px 0 16px 0;\"/><p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; text-align: center;\">Legal Practice Management System &bull; Privileged &amp; Confidential Attorney-Client Notice</p></div></div>",
