to an existing adverse party or organizational conflict of interest.</p><p style=\"color: #7f1d1d; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\"><strong>Grounds for Determination:</strong> {{ $('Conflict Review Form').first().json['Resolution Comments / Justification'] }}</p></div><div style=\"background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 22px;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"7\" style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\"><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;\"><td style=\"width: 38%; color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;\">Case Reference ID:</td><td><code style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; background: #e2e8f0; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px;\">#{{ $('Lookup Case in Directory').first().json.case_id }}</code></td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;\"><td style=\"color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;\">Matter Status:</td><td><span style=\"background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;\">CLOSED / DECLINED</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;\">Determination Date:</td><td><span style=\"color: #475569;\">{{ $now.toFormat('dd LLL yyyy') }}</span></td></tr></table></div><p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6;\">Please note that any documents or details uploaded have been handled with strict confidentiality. We encourage you to seek timely alternative counsel to ensure no statutory filing or limitation deadlines are prejudiced.</p><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 24px 0 16px 0;\"/><p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; text-align: center;\">Legal Practice Management System &bull; Privileged &amp; Confidential Legal Communication</p></div></div>",
